'''BASILISK''' is an international esports organization.

The org's StarCraft II team was hinted during [[HomeStory_Cup/21|HomeStory Cup XXI]]. BASILISK increased the prize pool for the event from $26,000 to $42,000 by giving out an additional $500 to each player.

The StarCraft II team was formally announced on September 8, 2022.

