Virtus.pro is a very old Russian e-sports organization, mostly famous for their team in Counter-Strike 1.6 their dominant DotA 2 team.

The team was created November 1, 2003, as a Moscow-based Counter-Strike squad. A few years later, a Need for Speed division was picked up, and May 2007 a DotA team as well. Their CS squad has reached several achievements over the years, and Virtus.pro is probably still to many associated with "Vigoss", one of the biggest DotA-legends ever, who played for the team during their days of glory.<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/en/history/ Virtus.pro history]</ref>

After 10 years of hiatus, on May 15, 2024, '''the StarCraft II Division is reformed''' with [[Astrea]] as the first player!<ref>[https://twitter.com/virtuspro/status/1790796768130503019 SC2 Divison reformed!]</ref>

==History==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2026
|name2=2025
|name3=2024
|name4=2014
|name5=2012
|name6=2011
}}
{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}
*September 7, [[Classic (Kim Doh Woo){{!}}Classic]]'s contract has ended.<ref>[https://x.com/SC2_Classic/status/2097025175175024860 Classic's contract has ended.]</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}
*April 21, [[Classic (Kim Doh Woo){{!}}Classic]] joins the team.<ref>[https://x.com/virtuspro/status/1914311314987520244 Classic joins.]</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}
*May 15, after 10 years of hiatus, '''the StarCraft II Division is reformed''' with [[Astrea]] as the first player!<ref>[https://twitter.com/virtuspro/status/1790796768130503019 SC2 Divison reformed!]</ref>
*September 14, [[Astrea]] leaves Virtus.pro.<ref>[https://virtus.pro/en/articles/astrea-pokidaet-virtuspro Astrea leaves.]</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|4}}
*July 1st, [[Virtus.pro]] announced that they closed the StarCraft II section of their organization and that they would now focus on League of Legends instead.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://virtus.pro/news/virtus-pro-proshchayutsya-so-slivko/|title=Virtus.pro say goodbye to sLivko|author=Andrew «FUki» Kiryukin|publisher=Virtus.pro|date=July 1, 2014|accessdate=July 2, 2014}}</ref>. This move left [[sLivko]] team-less.
{{tabs dynamic/tab|5}}
*January 7th, Virtus.pro add former [[RoX|RoX.KIS]] player [[Neytpoh]].<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/VPBenQ%7CNeytpoh/ Virtus.pro add Neytpoh] {{Flag|ru}}</ref>
*February 25th, [[Siw]] joined Virtus.pro.<ref>
[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/Novyy-igrok-v-VPBenQ/ Siw joined Virtus.Pro] {{Flag|ru}}</ref>
*March 1st, [[Vasilisk]] leaves Virtus.pro.
*April 29th, [[Verdi]] joined Virtus.pro.
*May 8th, [[Verdi]] leaves to join [[Vega Squadron]].<ref>[http://hdgame.net/index.php/ru/starcraft-ii/371-verdi-vega-squadron.html 'Verdi rookie team Vega Squadron'] hdgame.net 08/05/2012.</ref>
*August 8th, [[Revolver]] goes back to his old team, [[NCM Clan]], while [[AtSky]] joins instead.<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/Izmeneniya-v-komande-Virtuspro%2ABenQ/ 'Changes in the composition Virtus.pro*BenQ'] virtuspro.org 11/08/2012.</ref>
* August 24th, [[Roll]] leave Virtus.pro.<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/Roll-pokidaet-VPBenQ/ 'Roll leaves the team'] virtuspro.org 24/08/2012.</ref>
*August 25th, [[sLivko]] joined Virtus.pro.<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/Vstrechayte-VPBenQsLivko/ 'Welcome - VPBenQsLivko!'] virtuspro.org 25/08/2012.</ref>
*October 10th, [[Siw]] is removed from the team after failing to notify the team management, and the WCG Russia administration of his lack of a passport, resulting in him not being able to attend the WCG Russian Finals, despite having qualified.<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/VPBenQ-proshchaetsya-s-Siwom/ 'VPBenQ goodbye Siw'] virtuspro.org. 10/10/2012.</ref>
*December 31st, the team announced that they have released [[AtSky]], [[Neytpoh]] and [[Turuk]] due to lack of results, announcing a "full lineup" in the coming months.<ref>[https://tl.net/forum/viewmessage.php?topic_id=390834]</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/tab|6}}
*November 30th, Virtus.pro StarCraft 2 division is announced with an initial roster of [[Revolver]], [[Vasilisk]], [[Turuk]], and [[Roll]].<ref>[http://www.virtuspro.org/news/StarCraft2/Virtuspro-otkryvayut-napravlenie-po-StarCraft2/ Team creation announcement] {{Flag|ru}}</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/end}}

