'''Weibo Gaming''' is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] based StarCraft II team.

It was previously known as '''DKZ Gaming''' (or, '''Dragon KaiZi Gaming''').  As DKZ Gaming, it was founded from the merge of [[Dragon Phoenix Gaming]] and [[KaiZi Gaming]] on March 13, 2023.

On June 9, 2024, it was announced that the team rebranded into '''Weibo Gaming'''.

On February 27, 2025, the team disbanded<ref>[https://weibo.com/7286625705/Pg8v3D3cd?refer_flag=1001030103_ DKZ disbands.]</ref> to then be revived on April 15, 2025 with [[SHIN]] joining<ref>[https://x.com/Weibogamingwin/status/1912072152964120941 SHIN joins.]</ref>.

On January 12, 2026 the team was disbanded again after [[SHIN]] left.<ref>[https://www.instagram.com/p/DTaKa1piBJs/ Weibo Gaming disbands!]</ref>

